#. reviewed_at: 2026-03-29
#. reviewer: Emma H
msgid "Running Tutorials"
msgstr "Exécuter les tutoriels"

#. review_status: human_locked
#. source_hash: 9d6c84c5
#. reviewed_at: 2026-03-29
#. reviewer: Emma H
msgid "To best use the tutorials, we recommend running them in a notebook environment:"
msgstr ""
"Pour tirer le meilleur parti des tutoriels, nous recommandons de les exécuter dans un "
"environnement de carnet :"

#. review_status: human_locked
#. source_hash: 5560f193
#. reviewed_at: 2026-03-29
#. reviewer: Emma H
msgid ""
":raw-html:`<i class=\"fas fa-download\"></i>` Download the notebook as an ``.ipynb`` file, save "
"it to your local machine, and open it with your local Jupyter kernel. See "
":ref:`basic_install_local_notebook`."
msgstr ""
":raw-html:`<i class=\"fas fa-download\"></i>` Téléchargez le carnet sous forme de fichier "
"``.ipynb``, enregistrez-le sur votre machine, puis ouvrez-le avec votre noyau Jupyter local. Voir"
" :ref:`basic_install_local_notebook`."

#. review_status: human_locked
#. source_hash: 1d8f4b99
#. reviewed_at: 2026-03-29
#. reviewer: Emma H
msgid ""
":raw-html:`<i class=\"fas fa-rocket\"></i>` Launch the same notebook directly in Google Colab for"
" a browser-based interactive session. See :ref:`basic_install_google_colab`."
msgstr ""
":raw-html:`<i class=\"fas fa-rocket\"></i>` Ouvrez ce même carnet directement dans Google Colab "
"pour une session interactive dans le navigateur. Voir :ref:`basic_install_google_colab`."

#. review_status: llm_draft
#. source_hash: 193c59eb
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can copy/paste the commands from the tutorials into your terminal. See "
":ref:`basic_install_cli`. If you are sanity-checking an environment before starting a tutorial, "
"run ``floodsr --version`` first and ``floodsr doctor`` when you need backend diagnostics."
msgstr ""
"Sinon, vous pouvez copier/coller les commandes des tutoriels dans votre terminal. Consultez "
":ref:`basic_install_cli`. Si vous vérifiez rapidement un environnement avant de commencer un "
"tutoriel, exécutez d'abord ``floodsr --version`` et ``floodsr doctor`` lorsque vous avez besoin "
"de diagnostics du backend."

#. review_status: human_locked
